  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping study for the capacities for trade facilitation project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie om DCFTA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen utg&#xf6;rs av en studie vars syfte &#xe4;r att utv&#xe4;rdera m&#xf6;jligheterna till export och regionalt samarbete f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;ringslivet i Transnistrienomr&#xe5;det genom att identifiera viktiga industrier med exportpotential, g&#xf6;ra en utv&#xe4;rdering av de flaskhalsar och hinder som finns avseende styrning, kapacitet, efterlevnad och reglering f&#xf6;r bolag fr&#xe5;n utvalda industrier samt erbjuda praktiska l&#xf6;sningar p&#xe5; de problem som identifieras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution consists of a study to assess the potential for export and cross-river cooperation of the business community in the Transnistria region, through the identification of main industries with export potential, an assessment of management, capacity, compliance and regulatory bottlenecks among enterprises from the selected industries as well as provide practical solutions to overcome them.</narrative>
  </description>
